You feel spoiled.

	As you have discovered, in version 3.1 the Wizard does not carry the
Amulet.  The Amulet is hidden on the deepest level of Gehennom, guarded by the
High Priest of Moloch.  You will need one of the items the Wizard was carrying
to get there, however.

	To gain access to the High Priest's lair, you need the Bell of Opening
(carried by the Quest Nemesis), the Candelabrum of Invocation (carried by Vlad
the Impaler), the Book of the Dead (carried by the Wizard), and seven candles.
None of the items can be cursed.  You can learn similar information by asking
the Oracle for a major consultation.  Once you've collected these items, come
back if you need more advice.

